insert into public.mr_survey_thresholds (key, value, definition, source) values
('top_box_high_min_share', 0.50,
 'The share of substantive responses choosing "3" (needs significant strategic focus) above which a sub-topic is treated as HIGH on the stakeholder side of the divergence register. The comparison is strictly greater than this value, so an even split is not high. The denominator is substantive responses only — respondents who were asked and gave a rating — excluding abstentions and skips; the denominator is printed beside every figure. This is an absolute level and is deliberately NOT top_box_gap_margin, which measures the difference between two groups. The two constants answer different questions and are expected to diverge.',
 'Judgement. A strict majority is the smallest threshold that can be stated in one defensible sentence: most of the people who answered flagged this. Finer thresholds imply a precision the response counts do not support — at twelve substantive responses, 0.50 selects seven respondents and both 0.60 and two-thirds select eight.'),
('preparer_low_below_severity', 2.5,
 'The severity below which a preparer determination is treated as LOW on the divergence register. The comparison is strictly less than this value: an impact is material at severity of 2.5 or above, and the two-dimension positive case lands exactly on 2.5, so a determination at the threshold is material and is not low. A determination that reaches materiality through the single-dimension escalation route is not low whatever its mean, because the engine has already carried it into the report. A determination whose severity cannot be computed, because the assignee abstained on one or more dimensions, is not low either: it is absent, and renders as its own state. This row is DISCLOSURE ONLY. lib/materiality/severity.ts is authoritative and the register calls its materiality determination rather than comparing against this value.',
 'Judgement, but constrained: the value is the materiality threshold itself rather than a tighter band, so the register surfaces exactly those determinations that fall on the non-disclosing side of the line, including marginal ones just below it. Recorded here so the assumption is disclosed with the others, and marked disclosure-only so it cannot become a second source of a number the engine already owns.');
